Third-party references

`silkern/integrations/vllm.py` implements a drop-in replacement for the
allocation-owning `triton_filter_and_convert_dcp_index` converter used by
vLLM's sparse MLA attention backend. No vLLM source is vendored in this
repository. The upstream revision the adapter's call signature, geometry
envelope, and file digests were checked against is recorded as
`UPSTREAM_COMMIT` and the `UPSTREAM_*_SHA256` constants in that module.

  vLLM -- https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm -- Apache License 2.0
  SGLang -- https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang -- Apache License 2.0

